<br/>If you've been following the progression lists for MSV and HOF, prioritize <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90508/shackle-of-eversparks">
