<img alt="White Tiger Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_raidpaladin_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">White Tiger Handguards</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86966/garalons-hollow-skull">
