<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-mogushan-vaults" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">This list represents the best progression picks available up to and including <b>Mogu'Shan Vaults</b> in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 1. Items to look out for in this phase are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89934/bonded-soul-bracers">
<img alt="Bonded Soul Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bonded Soul Bracers</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87050/steelskin-qiangs-impervious-shield">
<img alt="Steelskin, Qiang's Impervious Shield" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_pandaraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Steelskin, Qiang's Impervious Shield</span></a>. Both items retain their usefulness until far after progression. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87026/cloak-of-peacock-feathers">
<img alt="Cloak of Peacock Feathers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Peacock Feathers</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87024/nullification-greathelm">
<img alt="Nullification Greathelm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nullification Greathelm</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87036/soulgrasp-choker">
<img alt="Soulgrasp Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_110.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soulgrasp Choker</span></a> are technically upgrades over the items picked, however, they are highly sought after by other classes and would ultimately not last long enough to make them worth picking up. Conversely, some DPS may seek out <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87060/star-stealer-waistguard">
<img alt="Star-Stealer Waistguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidpaladin_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Star-Stealer Waistguard</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89937/band-of-bursting-novas">
<img alt="Band of Bursting Novas" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_a1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Bursting Novas</span></a> due to an abscence of other options. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87071/jang-xis-devastating-legplates">
<img alt="Jang-xi's Devastating Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jang-xi's Devastating Legplates</span></a> is an interesting pick-up, as it's the only relevant set of epic pants plate-wearers get to acquire, making it highly competitive as well. Since we're looking to trade in T14 tier pants in HOF we could instead opt for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89095/legguards-of-the-unscathed">
<img alt="Legguards of the Unscathed" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of the Unscathed</span></a>. Note that running the PvP 4 Piece set is still an strong upgrade over the set outlined here, independent of which exact pieces you opt to run. <br/>
