<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_jewelry_trinket_16.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Protection Paladin Trinkets in Phase 1</span></h2>Your trinket usage will be dictated by what it is that you and your raid need. A stamina trinket like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79329/relic-of-niuzao">
<img alt="Relic of Niuzao" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_ox.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Niuzao</span></a> will make you the least likely to die, especially in a 25-man raiding environment, while a trinket like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87160/stuff-of-nightmares">
<img alt="Stuff of Nightmares" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trinketpanda_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stuff of Nightmares</span></a> can offer a blend of defensive utility and offensive utility through the raw secondary stats and the Dodge proc effect.<br/>
<br/>Changing trinkets on an encounter-by-encounter basis is encouraged.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>
<ins>Defensive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79329/relic-of-niuzao">
<img alt="Relic of Niuzao" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_ox.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Niuzao</span></a> (Active) — Massive Dodge boost on a short cooldown. Overbudgeted for its level and functions as a strong bonus cooldown in tight spots. A definite must-have in a tanks repertoire.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89079/lao-chins-liquid-courage">
<img alt="Lao-Chin's Liquid Courage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_drink_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lao-Chin's Liquid Courage</span></a> (Active)  —  Mastery tends to be the most reliable defensive stat, making this trinket the next-best defensive option to use in fights where you feel pressured.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86775/jade-warlord-figurine">
<img alt="Jade Warlord Figurine" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_139.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jade Warlord Figurine</span></a> (Active) —  A carbon copy version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89079/lao-chins-liquid-courage">
<img alt="Lao-Chin's Liquid Courage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_drink_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lao-Chin's Liquid Courage</span></a>, acquired from Mogu'Shan Vault trash mobs.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87160/stuff-of-nightmares">
<img alt="Stuff of Nightmares" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trinketpanda_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stuff of Nightmares</span></a> (Proc) —  This trinket offers less defensive utility than the Stamina counterparts, and it's long cooldown and unreliable proc make its value more of a gamble.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87063/vial-of-dragons-blood">
<img alt="Vial of Dragon's Blood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vial of Dragon's Blood</span></a> (Proc)  —  A slightly lower item level version of the other trinket. The shorter cooldown and weaker effect make it more reliable, but also less effective.</div></li></ul>
<ins>Offensive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87072/lei-shens-final-orders">
<img alt="Lei Shen's Final Orders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lei Shen's Final Orders</span></a> (Proc) — High passive Haste is nice, but the Strength proc carries the same issues as other proc trinkets. Its lower cooldown and less powerful effect make it more reliable than its competition.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87172/darkmist-vortex">
<img alt="Darkmist Vortex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/creatureportrait_cyclone_nodebris.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmist Vortex</span></a> (Proc) — A strong haste proc and the passive Strength is serviceable, but long cooldown and RNG timing reduce its reliability.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89083/iron-belly-wok">
<img alt="Iron Belly Wok" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_cooking_masterofthewok.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Iron Belly Wok</span></a> (Active) — Similar stats to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87172/darkmist-vortex">
<img alt="Darkmist Vortex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/creatureportrait_cyclone_nodebris.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmist Vortex</span></a>, but with an on-use effect. More predictable and better suited to planned pulls.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86771/jade-charioteer-figurine">
<img alt="Jade Charioteer Figurine" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mount_ridinghorse.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jade Charioteer Figurine</span></a> (Active) —  A carbon copy of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89083/iron-belly-wok">
<img alt="Iron Belly Wok" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_cooking_masterofthewok.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Iron Belly Wok</span></a>, acquired from Mogu'Shan Vault trash mobs.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79327/relic-of-xuen">
<img alt="Relic of Xuen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_tiger.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Xuen</span></a> (Proc) — Likely one the the best offensive trinkets on fights where you take little damage, purely on account of the raw value provided given its item level. Might be prohibitively expensive and cannot be equipped simultaenously with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79329/relic-of-niuzao">
<img alt="Relic of Niuzao" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_ox.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Niuzao</span></a>.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
