<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Protection Paladins in Phase 1</span></h2>Reputation gear is very strong and we recommend pushing each faction to at least <span class="rep-honored">Honored</span> reputation. Going beyond that depends on your gear needs and personal preference. Since most reputation rewards cost <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, there’s a natural trade-off to consider, but this becomes less of an issue as the phase goes on and the Valor cap increases. Two exceptions worth noting: <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> offer an excellent ring at <span class="rep-exalted">Exalted</span> which is also a BiS option for <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-challenge-mode-talents-bis-tips">Challenge Modes</a>, and <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> offer a strong necklace.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-klaxxi">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
